  "ALL_TEXT": "22 INT. GOVARDHAN\u2019S HOUSE-HALL - DAY\nGOVARDHAN walks into the hall, where the TV is playing a song\nwith Nayanthara.\nGOVARDHAN\n(loudly)\nOrei!ANJI! Nenu chachipothanu ra\nANJI walks in\nANJI\nSaar aymaindi\nGOVARDHAN\nAdhenti!\nANJI looks with excitement.\nANJI\nNayanthara saar, vachina kottalo\nboddhuga muddhuga vundedhi...ippudu\nslim gaa sukumaaram gaa\nundhi...time dorrakka concentrate\ncheyadam ledhu kaani...oka saari\nmeeru vadilithe...\nGOVARDHAN\nNenu adugutundhi Nayanthara\ngurinchi kaadu, TV meedha aemundi\nani\nA cockroach slowly moves across the TV's face\nANJI\nIppudu champesthaanu saar\nGOVARDHAN\nIppudu champadam kaadhu, intlo unna\nvastuuvulanni bayata\npettu...mottham illanta vethuku\ninka enni vunnaayi...enni rakaala\njanthuvulu unnaayi...\n(MORE)\nGOVARDHAN (CONT'D)\nvaatini pattuko...illu\nkadugu...nenu vache varaku kadugutu\nne undu..nenu vachaaka vaatini\npudchi samaadhi chesi appudu\nlopalaaki veldam...\nANJI (V.O.)\nDhaani badlu oka saari nannu champi\nsamaadhi cheyyi raa...neeku nenu\nchesthunna seva inkevarikaina\nchesthe ippaatiki Nobel Prize iche\nvaaru\nGOVARDHAN\nBoddhinka pattukunaaka routine\nfollow avvu - kitchen vaipu raaku,\npadhahaaru saarlu dettol aesi aa\ncheyyi kadugu.\nCUT TO:",
